WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.451
The workspace you choose sets the tabs and sections that you see on an encounter.

1.2
00:00:05.451 --> 00:00:11.088
Step 1. Open the workspace picker. It is at the top right of the encounter page.

2.1
00:00:11.088 --> 00:00:13.231
Step 2. Find the workspace.

2.2
00:00:13.231 --> 00:00:17.790
The Workspace panel lists each Active workspace that you can see.

2.3
00:00:17.790 --> 00:00:22.427
To find one by its name, type in Search workspaces by name.

3.1
00:00:22.427 --> 00:00:26.136
Step 3. Choose the workspace. Select it in the list.

3.2
00:00:26.136 --> 00:00:31.058
Care saves it as your choice for all your encounters and clinical history,

3.3
00:00:31.058 --> 00:00:33.687
and opens its first visible tab.
